  "05:09 — 艾达·莫恩从道具库交出分藏七年的两把播放钥匙。": "05:09 — Ada Morne hands over, from the prop store, the two playback keys hidden apart for seven years.",
  "剧院地下保存着暮钟馆反向留声机、临终蜡筒和一口没有钟舌的实验铜钟。声学谱证明拉普拉斯负责从混乱中听见异常，特蕾莎负责为异常命名；这套分工已经被训练进反射动作。林渡只调度声源，没有把任何人推回指定位置。两人仍然擅长合作，但她们都明确表示：熟练不是同意，救过彼此也不是继续服役的契约。": "Beneath the theatre lie the Duskbell Hall's reverse phonograph, deathbed cylinders and an experimental bronze bell with no clapper. The acoustic score proves Laplace is to hear the anomaly out of the chaos and Theresa is to name it; this division has been trained into reflex. Lin Du only routes the sound sources, pushing no one back to an appointed place. The two are still good at working together, but both say plainly: skill is not consent, and having saved each other is no contract of continued service.",
  "如果她们只是重新成为旧搭档，为什么每一次成功配合后都主动打乱暮钟馆规定的站位？": "If they merely became old partners again, why do they, after every successful pairing, deliberately break the stations the Duskbell Hall laid down?",
  "同一声钟的两只蜡筒": "Two Cylinders of One Bell",
  "一只记录她找到出口，另一只记录她请求被留下；两份录音都没有剪接。": "One records her finding the exit, the other her asking to be kept; neither recording is spliced.",
  "雾灯城的声学档案允许一段录音有噪点，不允许同一秒钟拥有两种真实结局。": "Foglight City's acoustic archive allows a recording its noise, but not one second to hold two true endings.",
