  "00:43 — 第一只蜡筒录到拉普拉斯找到出口并请求不要敲钟。": "00:43 — The first cylinder catches Laplace finding the exit and begging that the bell not be struck.",
  "01:35 — 第二只蜡筒录到她失去完整语言并请求切断联系。": "01:35 — The second cylinder catches her losing whole speech and begging that the tie be cut.",
