  "01:51 — 费利克斯把最终报告推到第三见证者的位置。": "01:51 — Felix pushes the final report to the third witness's place.",
  "03:06 — 拉普拉斯替特蕾莎说出名字，特蕾莎第一次只负责聆听。": "03:06 — Laplace speaks the name for Theresa, and Theresa, for the first time, only listens.",
  "04:22 — 固定角色被交换以后，第十三声找不到进入现实的方向。": "04:22 — With the fixed roles swapped, the thirteenth toll can find no way into reality.",
  "05:00 — 未签报告留在桌上，两只不成对手套被各自取回。": "05:00 — The unsigned report stays on the desk, and the two unpaired gloves are each taken back.",
  "暮钟馆把拉普拉斯和特蕾莎训练成一对相反证人，再要求第三个人把她们压成唯一结论。公开特蕾莎的版本可以暂时维持制度，却会让拉普拉斯从档案中消失；切断名字能安全封闭裂隙，也会删除两人的共同历史。证据最完整的方向是不签那份唯一报告：拉普拉斯替特蕾莎命名，特蕾莎替拉普拉斯聆听，角色交换以后，钟后聆听者无法再把她们固定成入口。": "The Duskbell Hall trained Laplace and Theresa into a pair of opposing witnesses, then asked a third person to press them into a single conclusion. Making Theresa's version public can uphold the institution for a while, but it makes Laplace vanish from the files; severing the names can safely close the rift, but it deletes the two women's shared history. The fullest direction for the evidence is not to sign that single report: Laplace names for Theresa, Theresa listens for Laplace, and once the roles are swapped the listener behind the bell can no longer fix them into an entrance.",
  "当两段记忆与两个当前人格都真实存在，调查者还有什么资格用整齐的报告删除其中一个？": "When two memories and two present selves both truly exist, what right has the investigator to delete one with a tidy report?",
