  "你用“校准拉普拉斯蜡筒的出口回声”处理了第 3 夜的矛盾证词，没有把熟练配合误写成继续服从。": "By choosing 'Calibrate the exit echo on Laplace's cylinder', you handled Night 3's contradictory testimony without miswriting practised cooperation as continued obedience.",
