  "城市愿意容纳十二声报时；第十三声只在有人准备删去另一段人生时出现。 林渡选择“提交特蕾莎的唯一官方版本”以后，只记录可验证的声源、笔迹与时间，不替当事人恢复暮钟馆站位。": "The city will hold twelve tolls of the hour; the thirteenth appears only when someone is ready to delete another life. After Lin Du chose 'Submit Theresa's single official version', he recorded only verifiable sound sources, handwriting and timings, restoring no one to a Duskbell Hall station.",
  "我按“提交特蕾莎的唯一官方版本”走完这一夜。暮钟馆把拉普拉斯和特蕾莎训练成一对相反证人，再要求第三个人把她们压成唯一结论。公开特蕾莎的版本可以暂时维持制度，却会让拉普拉斯从档案中消失；切断名字能安全封闭裂隙，也会删除两人的共同历史。证据最完整的方向是不签那份唯一报告：拉普拉斯替特蕾莎命名，特蕾莎替拉普拉斯聆听，角色交换以后，钟后聆听者无法再把她们固定成入口。": "I followed 'Submit Theresa's single official version' through the night. The Duskbell Hall trained Laplace and Theresa into a pair of opposing witnesses, then asked a third person to press them into a single conclusion. Making Theresa's version public can uphold the institution for a while, but it makes Laplace vanish from the files; severing the names can safely close the rift, but it deletes the two women's shared history. The fullest direction for the evidence is not to sign that single report: Laplace names for Theresa, Theresa listens for Laplace, and once the roles are swapped the listener behind the bell can no longer fix them into an entrance.",
