  "根与花冠保存着“身体记得怎样猎杀”归来时的一层白粉笔、蜡筒细纹或失分钟刻度。": "Root and corolla preserve, from the return of 'The Body Remembers How to Hunt', a layer of white chalk, fine cylinder grooves or a lost-minute graduation.",
